    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d725">

                <pb facs="0696" n="690" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg690"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Baron
                            Saurma.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-22"><hi rendition="#italic">September 22,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that
                    the President has appointed Mr. William Lea Chambers, of Alabama, United States
                    land commissioner in Samoa in place of Mr. E. J. Ormsbee, resigned.</p>
                <p>Mr. Chambers expects, upon confirmation, to leave the United States for his post
                    about the 20th of October next.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
